# ADMTST - Exercise the ADM3A personality

```text
ADMTST
```

## Run the test

Use RSX LIST to check the active personality. Load ADM3A if needed, then
run ADMTST. Observe the cursor, cleared regions and bell as you follow
the prompts.

## Keyboard check

Type uppercase A, colon, left bracket and right bracket when prompted.
Each key is read immediately. A pass confirms that key sequence. Check
the displayed pages and audible bell separately. See
[RSX](RSX.HLP#select-a-terminal) to switch personalities.
